		{"id":"0000000000000002","type":"text","x":983,"y":40,"width":880,"height":254,"text":"## 邓小铁 Xiaotie Deng\n\n**北京大学｜72 项公开成果**\n\n2024 · 23 项｜2025 · 26 项｜2026 · 23 项\n\n2024 至 2026-11-24 可核实的公开论文与预印本。会议版、期刊版与预印本合并，按区间内较早的可核实版本归年。数据与代码归入对应论文。\n\n[北京大学教师主页](https://cs.pku.edu.cn/info/1241/2141.htm) · [DBLP](https://dblp.org/pid/d/XiaotieDeng.html) · [ORCID](https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5282-6467) · [OpenAlex](https://openalex.org/A5100638710)","color":"#64748B"},
		{"id":"0000000000000003","type":"text","x":36,"y":398,"width":526,"height":1006,"text":"## 2024｜1–8 / 23\n\n- **让神经网络设计确定性拍卖** · 自动机制设计、虚拟估值、收益分解  \n  [Automated Deterministic Auction Design with Objective Decomposition](https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.11904)（2024 预印，WWW 2026 正式版）\n\n- **分析有资源约束的情境在线决策** · 背包约束、在线学习、后悔界  \n  [Contextual Decision-Making with Knapsacks Beyond the Worst Case](https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2024/hash/a0e1c2c40fc245b5fe7251ea33fbb045-Abstract-Conference.html)（NeurIPS 2024）\n\n- **在价值隐含和反馈截尾时学习阈值** · 隐变量、截尾反馈、阈值学习  \n  [Learning Thresholds with Latent Values and Censored Feedback](https://proceedings.iclr.cc/paper_files/paper/2024/hash/5cfdd20216dc20e50379a00a83608b0b-Abstract-Conference.html)\n\n- **让多个奖励模型如实表达偏好** · LLM 微调、奖励聚合、激励相容  \n  [Mechanism Design for LLM Fine-tuning with Multiple Reward Models](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.16276)（2024 预印，NeurIPS 2025）\n\n- **〔广告或推荐〕协调电商平台的广告位与自然结果** · 广告与自然流量、激励相容、排名  \n  [Ad vs Organic: Revisiting Incentive Compatible Mechanism Design in E-commerce Platforms](https://doi.org/10.1145/3589334.3645638)（The Web Conference 2024）\n\n- **〔广告或推荐〕用大规模广告拍卖平台评测自动出价** · Auto-Bidding 竞赛、仿真系统、投放基准  \n  [Auto-Bidding in Large-Scale Auctions: Learning Decision-Making in Uncertain and Competitive Games](https://openreview.net/pdf?id=ZejUjZUF6i)（NeurIPS 2024 竞赛提案）\n\n- **〔广告或推荐〕分析先验不可靠时的预算约束广告拍卖** · 预算控制、策略等价、拍卖结构  \n  [Budget-Constrained Auctions with Unassured Priors: Strategic Equivalence and Structural Properties](https://doi.org/10.1145/3589334.3645344)（The Web Conference 2024；已有 2022 预印本）\n\n- **〔广告或推荐〕在重复二价广告拍卖中控制支出** · 预算节流、重复竞拍、在线学习  \n  [Dynamic Budget Throttling in Repeated Second-Price Auctions](https://doi.org/10.1609/aaai.v38i9.28816)（AAAI 2024；已有 2022 预印本）"},
		{"id":"0000000000000005","type":"text","x":598,"y":398,"width":526,"height":1006,"text":"## 2024｜9–16 / 23\n\n- **辅助推导多人近似纳什均衡算法** · LegoNE、计算机辅助证明、多玩家  \n  [A Computer-Aided Approach for Approximate Nash Equilibria](https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-032-08560-3_18)（WINE 2024，Springer 2026 论文集）\n\n- **研究对立的条件偏好能否汇总** · 社会选择、条件偏好、聚合  \n  [Aggregation of Antagonistic Contingent Preferences: When Is It Possible?](https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.08127)（2024 预印，WINE 论文集（2026 出版））\n\n- **检验有界合约可否学习及近似最优** · 合约设计、学习复杂度、有界支付  \n  [Are Bounded Contracts Learnable and Approximately Optimal?](https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.14486)（ACM EC 2024）\n\n- **研究多场双人彩票竞赛如何相互竞争** · 彩票竞赛、竞赛设计、均衡  \n  [Competition among Pairwise Lottery Contests](https://doi.org/10.1609/aaai.v38i9.28823)\n\n- **研究多场并行排名竞赛的竞争** · 排名竞赛、奖金分配、均衡  \n  [Competition among parallel contests](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ic.2025.105339)（2024 SSRN 预印，2025 期刊版）\n\n- **在区块链公共品资助中利用专家意见** · 公共品、去中心资助、专家建议  \n  [Decentralized Funding of Public Goods in Blockchain System: Leveraging Expert Advice](https://doi.org/10.1109/tcc.2024.3394973)\n\n- **为受限排序学习构建偏好数据** · 排序偏好、成对标注、数据稀缺  \n  [Hummer: Towards Limited Competitive Preference Dataset](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.11647)\n\n- **用深度学习求大规模情境市场均衡** · 市场均衡、情境变量、神经求解  \n  [Large-Scale Contextual Market Equilibrium Computation through Deep Learning](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.15459)（2024 预印，FAW 2025）"},
		{"id":"0000000000000007","type":"text","x":1160,"y":398,"width":526,"height":1006,"text":"## 2024｜17–23 / 23\n\n- **设计交换市场的分配与激励** · 交换经济、市场设计、资源配置  \n  [Mechanism Design for Exchange Markets](https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.07023)\n\n- **研究 DeFi 中交易重排的经济影响** · 交易排序、DeFi、攻击分析  \n  [n-MVTL Attack: Optimal Transaction Reordering Attack on DeFi](https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-51479-1_19)\n\n- **在双矩阵博弈中优化策略混合** · 近似纳什均衡、混合策略、二人博弈  \n  [On the optimal mixing problem of approximate Nash equilibria in bimatrix games](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.tcs.2025.115072)（FAW 2024，TCS 2025 期刊版）\n\n- **分析扩展式博弈中对承诺策略的操纵** · 私人收益、扩展式博弈、策略承诺  \n  [Optimal private payoff manipulation against commitment in extensive-form games](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.geb.2024.11.008)（2024 在线，GEB 2025 卷期）\n\n- **构造区块链密封投标拍卖** · 密封投标、定时承诺、链上机制  \n  [Sealed-bid Auctions on Blockchain with Timed Commitment Outsourcing](https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.10607)\n\n- **分析资源交易网络中的女巫攻击激励** · 资源交换、市场均衡、虚假身份  \n  [Tight incentive analysis of Sybil attacks against the market equilibrium of resource exchange over general networks](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.geb.2024.10.009)\n\n- **〔综述〕有限标准型博弈的纳什均衡算法综述** · 纳什均衡、精确算法、近似算法  \n  [A survey on algorithms for Nash equilibria in finite normal-form games](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cosrev.2023.100613)"},
		{"id":"0000000000000009","type":"text","x":1722,"y":398,"width":526,"height":1006,"text":"## 2025｜1–8 / 26\n\n- **评估 LLM 的多人多轮社交能力** · 社交智能体、互动基准、多用户  \n  [How Social is It? A Benchmark for LLMs' Capabilities in Multi-user Multi-turn Social Agent Tasks](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.04628)\n\n- **评估 LLM 能否交互引导数据分析** · 交互基准、多轮引导、分析任务  \n  [IDA-Bench: Evaluating LLMs on Interactive Guided Data Analysis](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.18223)\n\n- **不用离散化学习真实投标机制** · 策略无关、拍卖学习、连续估值  \n  [Learning Truthful Mechanisms without Discretization](https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.22911)（2025 预印，AAMAS 2026）\n\n- **处理竞拍结果对他人预算的影响** · 预算外部性、拍卖机制、分配支付  \n  [Mechanism Design for Auctions with Externalities on Budgets](https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.14948)（FAW 2025）\n\n- **〔广告或推荐〕为线上广告自动出价规划预算** · 投放计划、预算约束、自动出价  \n  [An Adaptable Budget Planner for Enhancing Budget-Constrained Auto-Bidding in Online Advertising](https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.05187)（KDD 2025）\n\n- **〔广告或推荐〕统一优化电商广告和自然流量** · 全站推、整站营销、流量分配  \n  [Beyond Advertising: Mechanism Design for Platform-Wide Marketing Service \"QuanZhanTui\"](https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.02931)（KDD 2025）\n\n- **〔广告或推荐〕学习应对不可信的二价广告拍卖** · 平台承诺、重复竞拍、预算分配  \n  [Learning against Non-credible Second-Price Auctions](https://doi.org/10.1145/3696410.3714847)（The Web Conference 2025）\n\n- **用梯度下降逼近多人纳什均衡** · 连续优化、多玩家、近似均衡  \n  [Approximating N-Player Nash Equilibrium through Gradient Descent](https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.03001)"},
		{"id":"000000000000000b","type":"text","x":2284,"y":398,"width":526,"height":1006,"text":"## 2025｜9–16 / 26\n\n- **自动分析两人博弈算法的近似精度** · 双人博弈、计算证明、纳什均衡  \n  [Automating approximation analysis for Nash equilibria algorithms in two-player games](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ic.2025.105362)\n\n- **从运营数据自动生成业务规则** · 预测模型、规则学习、混合搜索  \n  [DeepRule: An Integrated Framework for Automated Business Rule Generation via Deep Predictive Modeling and Hybrid Search Optimization](https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.03607)\n\n- **让 LLM 发现专家级近似均衡算法** · LegoNE、算法发现、近似纳什均衡  \n  [Discovering expert-level Nash equilibrium algorithms with large language models](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-026-74003-1)（2025 预印，Nature Communications 2026）\n\n- **设计让参与者如实申报分布的机制** · 事前激励相容、分布申报、支付  \n  [Ex-Ante Truthful Distribution-Reporting Mechanisms](https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.04030)（2025 预印，WINE 论文集（2026 出版））\n\n- **比较垄断和竞争下的最优竞赛设计** · 竞赛竞争、设计者均衡、奖励  \n  [From monopoly to competition: When do optimal contests prevail?](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.geb.2025.07.001)\n\n- **讨论大模型为什么需要符号能力** · 符号推理、神经符号、模型架构  \n  [How Large Language Models Need Symbolism](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.21404)\n\n- **对长文本进行结构感知的风格迁移** · 句段映射、长文本、风格生成  \n  [Implementing Long Text Style Transfer with LLMs through Dual-Layered Sentence and Paragraph Structure Extraction and Mapping](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.07888)\n\n- **从最优承诺反推领导者的激励** · Stackelberg 博弈、逆向学习、策略承诺  \n  [Learning a Stackelberg Leader's Incentives from Optimal Commitments](https://doi.org/10.1145/3736252.3742612)（ACM EC 2025）"},
		{"id":"000000000000000d","type":"text","x":36,"y":1508,"width":526,"height":958,"text":"## 2025｜17–24 / 26\n\n- **研究有异质玩家的网络数字公共品** · 公共品、网络博弈、凸成本  \n  [Networked Digital Public Goods Games with Heterogeneous Players and Convex Costs](https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.01001)\n\n- **设计公共品众筹资金分配机制** · 众筹、连续拍卖、真实捐款  \n  [Optimal Mechanism Design for Crowdfunding of Public Goods](https://ifaamas.csc.liv.ac.uk/Proceedings/aamas2025/pdfs/p2466.pdf)（AAMAS 2025 扩展摘要）\n\n- **并行排名竞赛如何分配奖金** · 排名激励、多竞赛、最优奖项  \n  [Optimal Prize Design in Parallel Rank-order Contests](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.08342)（2025 预印，WINE 论文集（2026 出版））\n\n- **用个人随机奖励改善区块链上报** · 链上报告、随机奖励、激励  \n  [Prrr: Personal Random Rewards for Blockchain Reporting](https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.12626)（2025 预印，IEEE S&P 2026）\n\n- **设计基于交易的数据共享机制** · 链上交易、数据共享、协议  \n  [TBDS: Transaction-Based Data Sharing](https://doi.org/10.1007/978-981-96-8312-3_17)\n\n- **提高轻量视觉语言模型的模态对齐** · 多模态、模型轻量化、表征对齐  \n  [TinyAlign: Boosting Lightweight Vision-Language Models by Mitigating Modal Alignment Bottlenecks](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.12884)（2025 预印，ACL Findings 2026）\n\n- **计算实验检验 AI 之间会不会交易** · 无交易定理、市场模拟、LLM  \n  [Will AI Trade? A Computational Inversion of the No-Trade Theorem](https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.17952)（2025 预印，WINE 论文集（2026 出版））\n\n- **〔综述〕智能投资决策强化学习进展综述** · 投资决策、强化学习、优化  \n  [A Survey on recent advances in reinforcement learning for intelligent investment decision-making optimization](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eswa.2025.127540)"},
		{"id":"000000000000000f","type":"text","x":598,"y":1508,"width":526,"height":958,"text":"## 2025｜25–26 / 26\n\n- **〔综述〕博弈论与 LLM 双向研究综述** · 博弈评估、机制设计、广告与商业化  \n  [Game Theory Meets Large Language Models: A Systematic Survey with Taxonomy and New Frontiers](https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.09053v2)（2025-08-05 arXiv v2 扩展版有邓署名，四作者 IJCAI 短版无邓署名）\n\n- **〔综述〕用强化学习分析战略挖矿综述** · 策略挖矿、强化学习、马尔可夫决策  \n  [Survey on Strategic Mining in Blockchain: A Reinforcement Learning Approach](https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.17307)（IJCAI 2025）"},
		{"id":"0000000000000011","type":"text","x":1160,"y":1508,"width":526,"height":958,"text":"## 2026｜1–8 / 23\n\n- **在容量约束下平衡商品组合的份额** · 随机选品、市场份额、容量约束  \n  [Cardinality-Constrained Randomized Assortments with Balanced Market Share](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.35802)\n\n- **利用投标人估值相关性设计支付** · 仿射最大化、相关估值、真实投标  \n  [Enhancing Affine Maximizer Auctions with Correlation-Aware Payment](https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.09455)\n\n- **用多智能体模拟消费者和市场** · 消费者偏好、LLM 智能体、经济沙盒  \n  [MALLES: A Multi-agent LLMs-based Economic Sandbox with Consumer Preference Alignment](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.17694)（KDD 2026）\n\n- **〔广告或推荐〕用类别机制在 LLM 回答中植入广告** · 广告类别、VCG、福利与体验  \n  [Ad Insertion in LLM-Generated Responses](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.19435)\n\n- **〔广告或推荐〕缓解生成式自动出价的冷启动** · 自动出价、稀缺引导、窄支撑探索  \n  [Iterative Scarcity-Guided Exploration: Bootstrapping Generative Auto-bidding from Narrow Support](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26060)\n\n- **〔广告或推荐〕用两阶段检索与大模型决定广告植入** · RAG、商业意图、广告竞拍  \n  [LERA: LLM-Enhanced RAG for Ad Auction in Generative Chatbots](https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.16474)\n\n- **〔广告或推荐〕总结自动出价竞赛与 AuctionNet 基准** · 竞赛复盘、广告竞拍、生成式出价  \n  [Lessons Learned from Auto-Bidding in the Large-Scale Auctions Competition at NeurIPS 2024](https://proceedings.mlr.press/v276/zhang26a.html)（PMLR 276，2026）\n\n- **用信息论判断哪些合成数据值得保留** · 数据合成、信息准则、样本效率  \n  [An Information-Theoretic Criterion for Efficient Data Synthesis](https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.16379)（2026 预印与 PMLR 会议版合并）"},
		{"id":"0000000000000013","type":"text","x":1722,"y":1508,"width":526,"height":958,"text":"## 2026｜9–16 / 23\n\n- **近似求解任意成本下的组合合约** · 组合合约、任意成本、近似算法  \n  [Approximating Combinatorial Contracts with Arbitrary Costs](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.35803)\n\n- **通过语义连通性减轻多模态幻觉** · 视觉语言模型、语义增强、幻觉  \n  [CoSE: connectivity-oriented semantic enhancement for mitigating hallucinations in multimodal LLMs](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.inffus.2026.104478)\n\n- **为去中心身份提供灵活隐私访问控制** · 去中心身份、隐私保护、权限  \n  [Flexible and Privacy-Preserving Access Control Framework for Decentralized Identity Systems](https://doi.org/10.1109/tifs.2026.3676653)\n\n- **分析少量玩家下近似均衡的计算难度** · 纳什均衡、复杂性、难度放大  \n  [Hardness Amplification for Approximate Nash Equilibrium with Constantly Many Players](https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.25608)\n\n- **在理论资料库中做分层检索生成** · 层次抽象、RAG、理论知识  \n  [HCAG: Hierarchical Abstraction and Retrieval-Augmented Generation on Theoretical Repositories with LLMs](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.20299)\n\n- **通过利润再分配鼓励数据交易** · 数据市场、利润分成、交易激励  \n  [Incentivizing Data Trading via Profit Reallocation](https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.31202)\n\n- **研究通过间接机制形成的稳定结果** · 间接机制设计、内生稳定、市场  \n  [Indirect Mechanism Design with Endogenous Stable Outcomes](https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=7489551)\n\n- **为视觉语言动作模型提供多租户后训练** · 服务化、VLA、多租户  \n  [JoyNexus: Service-Oriented Multi-Tenant Post-Training for VLA Models](https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.16074)"},
		{"id":"0000000000000015","type":"text","x":2284,"y":1508,"width":526,"height":958,"text":"## 2026｜17–23 / 23\n\n- **设计树状数据交易的收益再分配** · 树状市场、利润分配、数据交易  \n  [Profit Reallocation Mechanisms in Tree-based Data Trading](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.33506)\n\n- **用强化学习压缩跨领域推理链** · 思维链、长度控制、跨域泛化  \n  [Reinforcement Learning for Chain of Thought Compression with One-Domain-to-All Generalization](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.06052)（2025-12-19 提交，arXiv 于 2026 年首次公开）\n\n- **异步训练视觉语言动作模型** · VLA、强化学习、异步管线  \n  [RL-VLA$^3$: A Flexible and Asynchronous Reinforcement Learning Framework for VLA Training](https://arxiv.org/abs/2602.05765)\n\n- **提高仪表读数的状态一致性** · 仪表识别、视觉评测、状态一致  \n  [State Beyond Appearance: Diagnosing and Improving State Consistency in Dial-Based Measurement Reading](https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.26614)\n\n- **委托人如何披露代理的可选行动** · 委托代理、行动空间、信息披露  \n  [Strategic Disclosure of Action Space in Principal-Agent Contracts](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.25410)\n\n- **构造可追溯且保护隐私的医疗数据交换** · 医疗数据、去中心化、公平交易  \n  [Traceable, Fair and Privacy-Preserving Decentralized Medical Data Exchange](https://doi.org/10.1109/tbdata.2026.3702418)\n\n- **设计按偏好排序的真实近似匹配** · 秩最优匹配、帕累托效率、真实申报  \n  [Truthful approximation for rank-maximal matchings](https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0890540126000027)（期刊版；包含 WINE 2023 的前期工作）"},
		{"id":"0000000000000018","type":"text","x":1073,"y":2691,"width":700,"height":140,"text":"## 先找综述，再筛原始研究\n\n先用综述看已有框架。再看原始论文回答的是生成、投放、竞价还是评估。与这些问题相邻的工作按需保留。","color":"#64748B"},
		{"id":"000000000000001e","type":"text","x":36,"y":2941,"width":666,"height":180,"text":"### 综述与领域入口\n\n**作者书目中的综述归类 · 4 项**\n\n先读作者参与的博弈论与 LLM 扩展综述，广告见 §4.1.4。再用外部 LLM 广告概览和自动出价综述校准范围。书目中的投资决策、战略挖矿和纳什均衡算法综述是其他方向。","color":"#397766"},
		{"id":"0000000000000020","type":"text","x":738,"y":2941,"width":666,"height":180,"text":"### 直接相关的广告与推荐\n\n**作者书目中的广告与推荐归类 · 11 项**\n\n两条线。一条在对话生成中整合赞助信息并确定支付，另一条研究电商场景下的广告与自然流量、商家预算和自动出价。","color":"#396A9A"},
		{"id":"0000000000000022","type":"text","x":1440,"y":2941,"width":666,"height":180,"text":"### 相邻研究\n\n**作者书目中的相邻归类 · 11 项**\n\n补机制设计与多智能体评测背景。分别看训练奖励、连续机制，以及消费者偏好如何在实验里表达。","color":"#95723E"},
		{"id":"0000000000000024","type":"text","x":2142,"y":2941,"width":666,"height":180,"text":"### 其余公开工作\n\n**作者书目中的其他归类 · 46 项**\n\n目录中留存其他方向。第一轮扫中文短题和关键词，后续按具体问题回查。","color":"#697281"},
		{"id":"0000000000000027","type":"text","x":36,"y":3346,"width":666,"height":175,"text":"### 作者综述 · 博弈论与大模型\n\n从广告与变现段 §4.1.4 入手。它比较 token、检索、摘要与输出层拍卖。邓小铁署名于 2025-08-05 的 arXiv v2 扩展版。\n\n[Game Theory Meets Large Language Models · §4.1.4](https://arxiv.org/html/2502.09053v2#S4.SS1.SSS4)","color":"#397766"},
		{"id":"0000000000000029","type":"text","x":36,"y":3611,"width":666,"height":175,"text":"### 外部综述入口 · 如何搭一个 LLM 广告系统\n\n先看框架，再看不同广告机制怎么安排候选检索、排序、生成和支付。可与作者扩展综述的广告小节对读。\n\n[Online Advertisements with LLMs · Feizi 等](https://www.sigecom.org/exchanges/volume_22/2/FEIZI.pdf)","color":"#397766"},
		{"id":"000000000000002b","type":"text","x":36,"y":3876,"width":666,"height":175,"text":"### 外部对照 · 传统广告拍卖和自动出价\n\n左淞等综述回顾自动出价、预算和平台机制。用于分清新问题究竟来自生成式交互，还是已有的投放机制。\n\n[Auto-Bidding and Auctions in Online Advertising · 左淞等](https://doi.org/10.1145/3699824.3699838)","color":"#397766"},
		{"id":"000000000000002e","type":"text","x":738,"y":3346,"width":666,"height":175,"text":"### 对话中插广告 · 类别机制\n\n先生成原回答，再把广告主预交的素材插入选中的位置。读按类别出价、VCG 支付，以及上下文连贯性怎么评估。\n\n[Ad Insertion in LLM-Generated Responses](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.19435)","color":"#396A9A"},
		{"id":"0000000000000030","type":"text","x":738,"y":3611,"width":666,"height":175,"text":"### 对话广告检索 · LERA\n\n先用向量检索缩小候选，结合 LLM 相关性判断和出价选广告，再把胜出的广告放进提示词生成回答。关注相关性、时延和支付。\n\n[LERA · LLM-Enhanced RAG for Ad Auction](https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.16474)","color":"#396A9A"},
		{"id":"0000000000000032","type":"text","x":738,"y":3876,"width":666,"height":175,"text":"### 电商场景 · 付费与自然流量\n\n对照电商展示位里的付费、自然结果与平台整站营销服务。它们有助于确定生成式广告与既有流量机制的边界。\n\n[Ad vs Organic · 广告与自然结果](https://doi.org/10.1145/3589334.3645638) · [QuanZhanTui · 全站推](https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.02931)","color":"#396A9A"},
		{"id":"0000000000000034","type":"text","x":738,"y":4141,"width":666,"height":199,"text":"### 商家视角 · 预算和自动出价\n\n预算规划处理投放期内的资源分配，冷启动论文解决初始数据不足时的探索。竞赛复盘补上 AuctionNet 的任务设置和评测基准。\n\n[An Adaptable Budget Planner](https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.05187) · [Iterative Scarcity-Guided Exploration](https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26060) · [Lessons Learned from Auto-Bidding · 竞赛复盘](https://proceedings.mlr.press/v276/zhang26a.html)","color":"#396A9A"},
		{"id":"0000000000000037","type":"text","x":1440,"y":3346,"width":666,"height":175,"text":"### 多奖励模型的微调机制\n\n看多个奖励提供者如何如实报告偏好，以及机制怎样进入微调。可以和广告主偏好聚合做结构对照。\n\n[Mechanism Design for LLM Fine-tuning with Multiple Reward Models](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.16276)","color":"#95723E"},
		{"id":"0000000000000039","type":"text","x":1440,"y":3611,"width":666,"height":199,"text":"### 自动拍卖设计 · 机制是否可学\n\n确定性拍卖分解目标，连续机制学习处理估值离散化问题。适合作为广告分配和支付规则的技术背景。\n\n[Automated Deterministic Auction Design](https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.11904) · [Learning Truthful Mechanisms without Discretization](https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.22911)","color":"#95723E"},
		{"id":"000000000000003b","type":"text","x":1440,"y":3900,"width":666,"height":175,"text":"### 多智能体市场 · 消费者偏好\n\n重点看 MALLES 如何设置消费者、商家与偏好。把模拟互动的结论和真实平台投放的证据分开。\n\n[MALLES · 多智能体经济沙盒](https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.17694) · [How Social is It? · 多人多轮互动基准](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.04628)","color":"#95723E"},
		{"id":"000000000000003d","type":"text","x":2142,"y":3346,"width":666,"height":175,"text":"### 会中作者的引用线索\n\n扩展综述 §4.1.4 讨论左淞、Paul Dütting 与 Haifeng Xu 等的 token auction，也讨论 Michael J. Curry 等的真实聚合。这里是引用关系。\n\n[Token Auction](https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.10826) · [Truthful Aggregation](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05905)","color":"#64748B"},
		{"id":"000000000000003e","type":"text","x":2142,"y":3567,"width":666,"height":175,"text":"### 从王同翰的画布接过来\n\n王同翰等的 NaiAD §6 把邓小铁等的广告插入研究放在机制与算法中。读两篇时可以对照它们怎样处理相关性与用户体验。\n\n[NaiAD · 相关工作](https://arxiv.org/html/2605.09918v1#S6) · [Ad Insertion · 原文](https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.19435)","color":"#64748B"},
		{"id":"000000000000003f","type":"text","x":2142,"y":3788,"width":666,"height":175,"text":"### 书目版次\n\n博弈论与 LLM 综述计入 2025 年 arXiv v2 扩展版。IJCAI 同题短版为四作者版本，邓小铁不在其署名中。LegoNE 代码是论文配套成果。\n\n[arXiv v2 署名](https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.09053v2) · [IJCAI 短版](https://www.ijcai.org/proceedings/2025/1184) · [LegoNE 配套代码](https://zenodo.org/records/20158034)","color":"#64748B"}
	],
